Module
  name: test_spelltour
  description: TEST ONLY (spells-video.yml, O692) - with the environment variable CHAOS_SPELLTOUR=1 it logs in with the staff character of CHAOS_LIVE_ACCOUNT / _PASSWORD, sets spell ranks, picks Forms and casts the shown spells and combos of one class with a caption each, and exits, so a manual workflow can film it. Without the variable it does nothing, no window, no hotkey, not in the hub menu
  author: Cinders of Chaos
  sandboxed: false
  scripts: [ spelltourlogic, spelltour ]
  dependencies:
    - client_entergame
    - game_chaosspells
    - game_spellranks
  autoload: true
  autoload-priority: 1200
  @onLoad: ChaosSpellTour.init()
  @onUnload: ChaosSpellTour.terminate()
